{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_05_926407421#1_1578721961","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of the same genetic disorder definition page and directly states that genetic disorders are heritable and passed down from parents' genes, with context about new mutations and germ-line inheritance.","learned":"Repeated evidence: genetic disorders are caused by genome abnormalities and can be passed down through parents' genes; new mutations are heritable when they occur in the germ line."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"hereditary disease\" inherited parents genes chromosomes)","reason":"Search for additional broad explanatory documents, preferably medical or educational, that describe hereditary disease inheritance through genes or chromosomes from parents."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"hereditary disease\" inherited parents genes chromosomes)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_50_368422422#0_764210655","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q191","rank":1,"snippet":"Location on the Body? Does Treatment Work for <cover>Inherited Psoriasis? Frequently used biologics include: \" , \"segment\": \"Is Psoriasis Hereditary? The Role Genetics Might Play in Psoriasis Is Psoriasis Hereditary? The Role Genetics Might Play in Psoriasis World Psoriasis day 29 octobre 2021 With advances in molecular genetics, the answer to the question is psoriasis hereditary, for the most part, is answered with yes. As an autoimmune disorder manifesting as layers of dead skin cells creating unsightly, thick red lesions, psoriasis affects nearly two percent of the population and often occurs with other autoimmune disorders, such as  Crohn's disease, Lupus, HIV. Results of human leukocyte antigen (HLA) studies have shown that psoriasis correlates with specific alleles  or one of a pair of genes found on certain chromosomes that are passed from parents to children. This hereditability of psoriasis is based on the fundamental principle of Mendel's law of segregation that Gregor Mendel discovered over 100 years ago. When Is Psoriasis Hereditary? Based on investigations of families suffering from psoriasis, epidemiological studies, HLA studies and genome linkage scans, the case for psoriasis being a hereditary disease </cover>is legitimate. However, just because someone inherits the psoriasis "}}
